5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I think we should be careful about how much work the new fee structure creates for the treasurer.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We need a realistic view of our finances to avoid guesswork. I want to see the actual numbers.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,We must ensure the new system doesn't alienate newcomers or make the club feel too rigid.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I've noticed people are hesitating to come to events lately. I want to know why the vibe has changed.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's obvious that a few of us do all the heavy lifting. I want to see if the attendance is as skewed as it looks.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, which records do you think would be most helpful for the budget?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,The ledger of outgoings and the bank statements for renewals should give us a clear picture of the cash flow.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I'm interested in how people joined mid-year and if that process was a barrier.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'll look into the turnout since the summer outings and maybe the winter social comments.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'm going for the sign-in sheets and the rota. Let's see who is actually showing up and working.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look into the treasurer's logged hours and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"That sounds sensible, Minato.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I'll check the minute books from the named-grade years and the taster evening forms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,Sounds like a plan.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Efficient.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
