60,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A is the easiest for the treasurer. I strongly prefer that to avoid burnout.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is the most stable for covering our fixed costs. It removes the guesswork from the budget.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,"I worry Option A scares off newcomers, but Option C is socially divisive. Option B might be too much work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"Option B is definitely out. It makes people hesitate to attend. Option A keeps the ""belonging"" feeling.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A is unfair to the active members, but Option C is a social disaster. I'll go with A for the sake of stability.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, maybe we can just be flexible with how people pay the annual fee?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That's a fair compromise. As long as the figure is set and known, we can manage the timing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"If we can make the annual fee accessible, it's better than creating grades or charging per door.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,I'm all for Option A. Let's just make it a welcoming environment again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we all agree on A, I can live with it, provided we acknowledge the effort of the regulars.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm happy with Option A.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting for Option A. It's the only rational way to ensure the bills are paid.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,I'll support Option A. It's the least likely to create a hierarchy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,Option A for me too!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll join the consensus. Option A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
